131221.en:
): I'm very glad you returned the young woman to her proper place. Under normal circumstances that would be the end of it and we'd all live happily ever after, if perhaps a little poorer in her uncle's case.

As it turns out, these are anything but normal circumstances. His niece wasn't kidnapped by a pirate captain; she eloped with him. Rubin Sozar had promised her that once he had finished some business nearby, they would start a new life together and that she would be treated like a princess. It's all a lie, of course - these people are no more capable of civilized behavior or affection than some wild animal would be.

You have to find that pirate and kill him, or he will simply trick the poor, deluded girl into eloping again. Her uncle assures me that she was treated horribly at the hands of these pirates, so badly, in fact, that he has been forced to lock her up in a section of his quarters and refuse to let anyone speak to her. He says she will remain there until she comes to her senses.

132273.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
You took too long, so I was forced to find someone else to deal with the Gallente cultists in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}. I am now rich, and you are now ... well, who cares? I'm rich. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132273.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
遅いぞ。おかげで{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}にいるガレンテのカルト信者を始末するのに他の人間を雇わなければならなかった。だがこれで私は大金持ちだ。それに比べてお前は...まあ、お前のことなどどうでもいい。私は金持ちになったんだからな。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132290.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
You took too long, so I was forced to find someone else to deal with the Gallente cultists in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}. I am now rich, and you are now ... not. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132290.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
遅いぞ。おかげで{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}にいるガレンテのカルト信者を始末するのに他の人間を雇わなければならなかった。だがこれで私は大金持ちだ。それに比べてお前はまあ...残念だな。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132306.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Because of your failure to deal with the stockpiles in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}, the Minmatar managed to escape back to their Republic with the stolen freight. You are not the only capsuleer, {[character]player.name}, and I‘d remind you to remember who pays your bills. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132306.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
君が{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}にある貯蔵品の奪還に失敗したおかげで、ミンマターは盗んだ積み荷を持って共和国に逃げ帰ってしまった。君だけが、カプセラではないのだぞ、{[character]player.name}。誰のおかげで暮らしていけているのか、よく考えることだ。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132307.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to find another mercenary squadron to deal with the Minmatar complex in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}, and not without considerable losses. Fortunately, you are not the only capable capsuleer working in our sovereignty. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132307.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
連絡がないので、{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}にあるミンマターの複合施設の任務は別の傭兵分隊に任せた。損失がなかったとは言いがたい。幸運なことに、我々の統治領内で働く優秀なカプセラは君だけではないのでな。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132407.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Unfortunately, given the amount of time that has passed since we last met, the Caldari mothership we discussed has now left {[location]dungeonLocationID.name} and rejoined its fleet. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132407.ja:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>

残念ながら、我々が最後に見つけてからかなりの時間が経過したので、話していたカルダリ母艦は{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}を去り、フリートに合流した。<br><br>

{[character]agentID.name}

132408.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to find another capsuleer to deal with the Caldari ship we discussed. Having had little time to prepare for the task, however, that pilot lost his ship and barely escaped in his pod. Thanks for your (lack of) effort. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132408.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
返事がなかったので、話していたカルダリ船の件で他の者を探す羽目になった。だが、任務遂行に十分な準備時間が取れず、パイロットは船を失い、かろうじてポッドで脱出したのだ。君の努力（不足）のおかげだよ。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132424.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Unfortunately, given the amount of time that has passed since we last met, the Gallente carrier we discussed has now left {[location]dungeonLocationID.name} and rejoined its fleet. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132424.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
残念ながら、我々が最後に会ってからかなりの時間が経過したので、話していたガレンテの艦載機母艦は{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}を去り、艦隊に合流した。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132425.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to find another capsuleer to deal with the Gallente ship we discussed. Having had little time to prepare for the task, however, that pilot lost his ship and barely escaped in his pod. If only you had moved more quickly to eliminate the threat... <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132425.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
返事がなかったので、話していたガレンテ船の件は他の者を探す羽目になった。だが、任務遂行に十分な準備時間が取れず、パイロットは船を失い、かろうじてポッドで脱出したのだ。君がもう少し早く連絡してくれれば、こんな苦労はせずに済んだのだが... <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132441.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Unfortunately, given the amount of time that has passed since we last met, the Minmatar carrier we discussed has now left {[location]dungeonLocationID.name} and rejoined its fleet. Thanks ... for nothing. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132441.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
残念ながら、我々が最後に会ってからかなりの時間が経過したので、話していたミンマターの艦載機母艦は{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}を去り、フリートに合流した。ありがとう... と建前だけの挨拶はしておこう。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132442.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to find another capsuleer to deal with the Minmatar menace we discussed. Having had little time to prepare for the task, however, the pilot of that expedition lost his ship and barely escaped in his pod. The mothership remains at large. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132442.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
返事がなかったので、話していたミンマターの件で他のカプセラを探す羽目になった。任務遂行に十分な準備時間が取れず、派遣したパイロットは船を失い、かろうじてポッドで脱出した。母船はまだ捕まっていない。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132459.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Unfortunately, the broadcast station in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name} that we discussed has now been reinforced by mercenary ships. Under the circumstances, I thought it prudent to call in the Navy to deal with this matter. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132459.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
残念ながら、我々が話していた{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}にある放送ステーションは、傭兵船団によって守りが固められてしまった。このような状況になってしまっては、海軍を呼んで始末を頼むのが妥当であろう。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

