132731.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to hire a small team of privateers to deal with the Amarr sanctum in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}. Fortunately, you are not the only capable starship captain working in Republic space. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132731.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
