133051.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your tardiness, I was forced to hire a small team of privateers to get the Sansha prisoners in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}. Fortunately, you are not the only capable starship captain about. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

133051.ja:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
君が遅れたせいで、{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}にいるサンシャの囚人を救い出すために、プライベーターの小規模なチームを雇わざるを得なくなった。幸いなことに、君だけが宇宙船の有能な船長というわけではない。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

133052.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Unfortunately, the Navy moved in and obliterated the Sansha Battletower in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}. One more golden opportunity left floating in the cold vacuum of space. That's life, I guess. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

133052.ja:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
残念なことに、海軍が{[location]dungeonLocationID.name}のサンシャバトルタワーに侵攻して破壊した。もう1つの絶好のチャンスが冷たい真空の宙域に浮いている。人生なんてそんなものさ。 <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

133261.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to call in the Navy to deal with the Minmatar battle station in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}. Consider yourself not hired. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

133261.ja:
{[character]player.name}、 <br><br>
